# Product intent and features

> Agent-maintained product snapshot. Update when capabilities or audience change.

## What this is

Browser-only **interview-prep** web app: structured lessons, interactive labs, and in-browser practice for system design and coding rounds. No backend — progress and drafts stay on the device.

Setup/commands: `README.md`, `AGENTS.md`.

## Audience

| Flow | Who |
|------|-----|
| High-level design (HLD) | Backend / platform / senior engineers |
| Low-level design (LLD) | SDE machine-coding / OO design |
| DSA + interview questions | Coding-round candidates |
| AI engineer | Engineers moving into ML / LLM systems |

## Core value props (shipped)

- **Five prep flows** with guided modules and lessons (`src/lib/data/courseData.js`)
- **Structured answers**: frame → estimate → sketch → defend (Practice IDE steps)
- **Topic labs**: decision guides, Mermaid, worked examples (`interactiveLessons.js`)
- **Simulation lab** (HLD): topology DSL + workload engine
- **Runnable coding**: DSA / question bank via WASM; ML scripts via Pyodide worker
- **Reveal-on-demand** sample answers and enhanced case-study solutions
- **Local progress** + export/import backup; optional user-keyed LLM coach with **Check (AI)** on practice, DSA, question bank, and simulation

## Feature map

| Area | Entry |
|------|--------|
| Curriculum / home | `src/routes/+page.svelte`, `courseData.js` → `siteOverview` |
| Flow / module / lesson | `src/routes/flow/…`, `module/…`, `module/…/lesson/…` |
| Topic lab | `LessonExplorer.svelte`, `AiLessonStudyGuide.svelte` |
| Simulation | `SimulationIDE.svelte`, `src/lib/simulation/` |
| Markdown practice | `PracticeIDE.svelte` |
| DSA / banks | `DsaPracticeIDE.svelte`, `QuestionBankIDE.svelte` |
| ML practice | `MLPracticeIDE.svelte`, `static/ml-py-worker.js` |
| Solutions / likely answers | `LessonSolutionPanel.svelte`, `interviewAnswers.js` |
| LLM panel / Check (AI) | `LlmAssistantPanel.svelte`, `llm/checkPrompts.js` (Practice, DSA, question bank, simulation) |
| Progress / backup | `progress.js`, `backup.js`, `ProgressControls.svelte` |

Scale today: **5 flows · 29 modules · 110 lessons**.

